questions.question_text:
An electricity bill summary is shown below.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\small},
  cell/.style={draw, minimum height=0.65cm, inner xsep=5pt, anchor=west},
  hdr/.style={cell, fill=gray!25, font=\small\bfseries}]
\def\colA{3.6cm} \def\colB{2.4cm}
\node[hdr, minimum width=\colA] (h1) at (0,0) {Charge Item};
\node[hdr, minimum width=\colB, right=0pt of h1] (h2) {Amount (ex GST)};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colA, below=0pt of h1.south west, anchor=north west] (a1) {Electricity Usage};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colB, right=0pt of a1] (a2) {\$300.00};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colA, below=0pt of a1.south west, anchor=north west] (b1) {Daily Supply Charge};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colB, right=0pt of b1] (b2) {\$90.00};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colA, below=0pt of b1.south west, anchor=north west] (c1) {Subtotal};
\node[cell, minimum width=\colB, right=0pt of c1] (c2) {\$390.00};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the total amount payable including $10\%$ GST?
